        "CISPO is canonically single-sided, but --eps-clip=%s keeps the lower clip bound %s active. "
        "Set --eps-clip 1.0 (and tune --eps-clip-high, e.g. 4.0) for the canonical wide setting.",
        args.eps_clip,
        1.0 - args.eps_clip,
